"Ligue o fone ao PC (cabo USB ou o adaptador 2.4G). O tutorial começa sozinho assim que o hub reconhecer o fone.": "Connect the headset to the PC (USB cable or the 2.4G adapter). The tutorial starts on its own as soon as the hub recognizes the headset.",
